[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598306671","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101680#issuecomment-2598306671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101680","id":2598306671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a3wNv","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T12:54:31Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T12:54:31Z","body":"You can close it like you would close a non-embedded game, so either by pressing the \"Stop Running Project\" button on the top right of the editor window or by pressing F8 as a shortcut.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598306671/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598310830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101680#issuecomment-2598310830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101680","id":2598310830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a3xOu","user":{"login":"yosimba2000","id":61702289,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzAyMjg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61702289?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000","html_url":"https://github.com/yosimba2000","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yosimba2000/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T12:56:55Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T12:59:03Z","body":"> You can close it like you would close a non-embedded game, so either by pressing the \"Stop Running Project\" button on the top right of the editor window or by pressing F8 as a shortcut.\n\nThank you, that works.\nSince the embedded window has a pause button, and the top right has both pause/stop buttons, would it also make sense to include a stop button for the embedded window as well? I feel that if the pause button is duplicated, then the stop button should be as well.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598310830/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598338871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101680#issuecomment-2598338871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101680","id":2598338871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a34E3","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T13:11:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T13:11:23Z","body":"> I feel that if the pause button is duplicated, then the stop button should be as well.\n\nThey aren't duplicated in functionality, only share the icon:\n- Suspend (the button in game view) only freezes the logic, which is what makes it possible to step frames, move around in overriden camera, select nodes and edit them in the inspector and see them update live.\n- Pause Running Project (F7) completely freezes the execution of the game, so for example if you update nodes through the inspector, they will not update until you unpause the project, and you cannot use any of the features of the game view like frame stepping or camera override.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactio